    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like it's never going to change. every day is the same struggle, the same exhaustion, the same feeling that i'm just a shell of a person. sometimes i just lie here and think about how much easier it would be if i could just sleep and not have to wake up to any of this. does that even make sense? it feels like the only way to actually get some peace.",
